onomictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/women-property-registrations-jump-45-in-chhattisgarh-after-fee-slash/132651962?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-1357565/132651962.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}